A-PROPOSAL-NBRC1507_Tris_HCl_01M_pH75_Buffer [
  {
    "path": "/component_assertion/notes",
    "before": "Source does not establish complete preparation composition; unreported solvent or pH-adjustment constituents remain unknown. No exhaustive list is claimed.",
    "after": "Source does not establish complete preparation composition; unreported solvent or pH-adjustment constituents remain unknown. No exhaustive list is claimed. Issue1237 W01-PREP-B-001: NBRC1507 names 0.1 M Tris/HCl (pH7.5) as a supplied buffer. It does not enumerate free hydrochloric acid as a separately added component. Retain the named buffer moiety and nominal strength; the complete constituent list, solvent, preparation and neutralization ratio remain unknown. No dry Tris-HCl substitution or neutralization chemistry is inferred."
  },
